This license applies to the Derived Surface Shading (DSS) method library: the
core algorithm and data files in this directory, namely

    dss.ts          - gradient & centroid normal fields, kernel weighting,
                      normal cache, and vertex-interpolated normals
    ao.ts           - occupancy-derived ambient occlusion
    meshBuilder.ts  - cube mesh construction with derived normals/AO applied
    VoxelData.ts    - sparse voxel volume / occupancy field
    palette.ts      - color palette model used by the above

Each of these files carries an `SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT` header. Other
files in this directory and elsewhere in the repository (including the voxel
editor application) are not covered by this license unless they too carry an
MIT SPDX header.

